 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.0": "The Rift",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.0.story": "At midnight the earth split and crimson light bled through. A gate of cursed obsidian... Beyond it, someone whispers your name.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.0.goal": "Find a Crimson Gate (or build one of Cursed Obsidian and light it) and step through.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.1": "The Fireborn",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.1.story": "Welcome to the Crimson Realm. Centuries ago the Tyrant Azgaroth seized the Crimson Throne, turned the five kingdoms against each other and split his power into five Sigils given to their lords. A prophecy speaks of a Fireborn from beyond the rift who will unite the Sigils and take the throne. The kingdoms are watching you.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.1.goal": "Find an envoy of a kingdom and speak with them (they roam the keeps and kingdom lands).",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.2": "Bargain for a Crown",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.2.story": "The envoys eyed you with suspicion, but they listened. Every kingdom guards a Sigil. You will earn it through friendship - or by bringing its lord to his knees.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.2.goal": "Win your first Sigil: forge an alliance with a kingdom or defeat its lord.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.3": "Five Sigils",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.3.story": "A Sigil burns in your palm. The other kingdoms now take you seriously - some with fear, some with envy. Remember: a promise to one makes its enemies yours.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.3.goal": "Gather all five Sigils.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.4": "The Crimson Throne",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.4.story": "The five Sigils resonate together. From deep within the Throne Wastes echoes the laughter of Azgaroth: \"Come then, Fireborn. My throne awaits you.\"",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.4.goal": "Combine the Sigils with a gold block into the Throne Key and use it in the Throne Wastes.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.5": "Sovereign",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.5.story": "The Tyrant has fallen. The banners of five kingdoms bow before you. You are the new sovereign of the Crimson Realm - but a crown belongs to the one who can bear it.",
 "chapter.krolasyonbosses.5.goal": "The realm is yours. Its kingdoms are sworn to you; crush your enemies with their armies.",
